import tests/games/lexi8/interface.dl
import tests/games/geometry_dash/interface.dl
import tests/games/gallery/interface.dl

seed the random number generator with 20260713
build the breakout program
set arcade to a new arcade session
set {console UI} to an instance of lexi arcade with state (the address of arcade)
set button to the control labeled "Pause" in (the address of console UI)
activate button belonging to lexi arcade in (the address of console UI)
require condition (arcade's paused) reporting "The Pause button did not pause Breakout"
require condition (console UI's page's text = "paused") reporting "Pause did not change the page"
set choices to the control labeled "Display tint" in (the address of console UI)
activate (the UI child at 2 in choices) belonging to choices in (the address of console UI)
require condition (arcade's palette = 2) reporting "The tint control did not change the display"
set button to the control labeled "New game" in (the address of console UI)
activate button belonging to lexi arcade in (the address of console UI)
require condition (not arcade's paused) reporting "New game did not resume Breakout"
require condition (arcade's palette = 2) reporting "Restart lost the display preference"
require condition (console UI's page's text = "playing") reporting "New game did not show the play page"
close the address of console UI
close the address of arcade

set route to a new route session
set {route UI} to an instance of geometry dash with state (the address of route)
set button to the control labeled "New level" in (the address of route UI)
activate button belonging to geometry dash in (the address of route UI)
require condition (route's seed = 1338) reporting "New level did not change the seed"
set button to the control labeled "Play" in (the address of route UI)
activate button belonging to geometry dash in (the address of route UI)
require condition (route's phase = 1) reporting "Play did not start the level"
refresh the route in (the address of route UI)
set button to the control labeled "Pause" in (the address of route UI)
activate button belonging to geometry dash in (the address of route UI)
require condition (route's paused) reporting "The Pause button did not pause the route"
refresh the route in (the address of route UI)
set button to the control labeled "Resume" in (the address of route UI)
activate button belonging to geometry dash in (the address of route UI)
require condition (not route's paused) reporting "The Resume button did not resume the route"
close the address of route UI
close the address of route

set gallery to a new gallery session
set {gallery UI} to an instance of shader atelier with state (the address of gallery)
set buttons to ["Mandelbrot", "Plasma", "Julia", "Rings", "Event Horizon"]
for each name at index in buttons:
    set button to the control labeled name in (the address of gallery UI)
    activate button belonging to shader atelier in (the address of gallery UI)
    require condition (gallery's selected = index) reporting "A gallery button selected the wrong study"
close the address of gallery UI
print line "Arcade controls passed"
